  <name>Pares Agens</name>
  <summary>Local-first AI agent desktop</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Pares Agens is a local-first AI agent desktop application. It embeds the
      Pares Agens and Pares Radix engines in-process to orchestrate agents,
      tools, and workflows on your own machine.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Runs agents locally with no mandatory cloud dependency.</li>
      <li>Integrates tools, channels, and models in a single workspace.</li>
      <li>Cross-platform desktop built on Tauri.</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
